Content-Type: application/json

### ================= SERIES =================
### List all series
GET http://localhost:3000/api/series

### Get series by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/series/1

### Create a series
POST http://localhost:3000/api/series
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_author": 1,
  "title": "Breaking Bad",
  "category": "Drama",
  "description": "Un profesor de química se convierte en fabricante de metanfetamina."
}

### ================= SEASONS =================
### List seasons of a serie
GET http://localhost:3000/api/seasons/serie/1

### Create a season
POST http://localhost:3000/api/seasons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_serie": 1,
  "season_number": 1,
  "description": "Primera temporada de Breaking Bad"
}

### ================= EPISODES =================
### List episodes of a season
GET http://localhost:3000/api/episodes/season/1

### Stream episode video
GET http://localhost:3000/api/episodes/1/stream

